<div align="center" class="pad-20"><h3 class="heading">WINTER BREAK</h3><div align="center" style="max-width: 800px;"><p>Students may register for their planned courses using their 
			<a href="mymercer.shtml">MyMercer student portal</a>. Please note that payment is due at the time of registration. 
			<a href="admissions_reg_process.shtml">Click here</a> for additional details.
		</p><p>For assistance with tuition payment on your account, please call 609-947-4810.</p><hr /><p>CMD &#8211; Call Center will continue to answer Financial Aid (609-570-3210) and Bursar (609-570-3499) calls during Mercer&#8217;s Winter Break at these times:</p><table class="table table-condensed table-responsive" style="max-width: 420px;"><tbody><tr><td>Dec. 24</td><td>9am &#8211; 1pm.</td></tr><tr><td>Dec. 26-27, Dec. 30</td><td>9am &#8211; 5pm.</td></tr><tr><td>Dec. 31</td><td>9am &#8211; 1pm.</td></tr></tbody></table><h5 class="color5">Happy Holidays!</h5></div></div>
